{"key":"RPGSystem/rpg-loc-dialogue-common-a1c10p2.json|/dataList/2/key","kr_sha":"dd92bb2ce9bca24e399a330a52a759bf265363398e64ea82d0e0b8c479614842","zh":"D91001_B","origin":"copy","since":"raw-20261029","rules":"fb2b0969a45c0ef78713157c38556f810fa441a5"}
{"key":"RPGSystem/rpg-loc-dialogue-common-a1c10p2.json|/dataList/2/texts/0/text","kr_sha":"f1ee4784e4e8b13f6322118e0a35e770a70138b205899b9142303948b1b434a0","zh":"或許我的前世真的曾經是一棵樹。","origin":"paratranz","since":"raw-20261029","rules":"fb2b0969a45c0ef78713157c38556f810fa441a5"}
{"key":"RPGSystem/rpg-loc-dialogue-common-a1c10p2.json|/dataList/2/texts/1/text","kr_sha":"e1c360c8cd5f5705517a5df0f16df545b8365e6dd11378a6fccde896df3ab66d","zh":"以樹木之姿呈現的心之圖像，以及其構造。","origin":"paratranz","since":"raw-20261029","rules":"fb2b0969a45c0ef78713157c38556f810fa441a5"}
{"key":"RPGSystem/rpg-loc-dialogue-common-a1c10p2.json|/dataList/2/texts/2/text","kr_sha":"ce323419c5cd3e43f285abb21463ebd5ac4624f2d6d3f368e9ffd0ec1e7def96","zh":"因為我深信那就是牽引而出的靈魂之姿。","origin":"paratranz","since":"raw-20261029","rules":"fb2b0969a45c0ef78713157c38556f810fa441a5"}
{"key":"RPGSystem/rpg-loc-dialogue-common-a1c10p2.json|/dataList/2/texts/3/text","kr_sha":"3be5be0df6a7b73799f4af87d9bc7c5546af45cbff1c51ff0f1647433d691782","zh":"但是……靈魂的模樣真的就是樹木嗎？","origin":"paratranz","since":"raw-20261029","rules":"fb2b0969a45c0ef78713157c38556f810fa441a5"}
{"key":"RPGSystem/rpg-loc-dialogue-common-a1c10p2.json|/dataList/2/texts/4/text","kr_sha":"c6458b848ae46f04929dc0c70ae8ad5a53780dafe7752fd535ea54774cf82742","zh":"靈魂只能以樹木的形式表達，畢竟心靈實在過於不穩定，所以才無法搭建起穩定結構。","origin":"paratranz","since":"raw-20261029","rules":"fb2b0969a45c0ef78713157c38556f810fa441a5"}
{"key":"RPGSystem/rpg-loc-dialogue-common-a1c10p2.json|/dataList/2/texts/5/text","kr_sha":"cb8f62d77b035d48ea8367ebe8c0ee232dedafbdad956a56f821e0df85552780","zh":"但在巡遊都市時所見，翼所對待的人類形貌最終收束於樹木的構造並反覆出現。","origin":"paratranz","since":"raw-20261029","rules":"fb2b0969a45c0ef78713157c38556f810fa441a5"}
{"key":"RPGSystem/rpg-loc-dialogue-common-a1c10p2.json|/dataList/2/texts/6/text","kr_sha":"69d12820cdac019fb54efeb7cee1dcb31541164843d16e292a8e517eaaa30d44","zh":"光看這張N公司的薛西弗斯系統設計圖不也是如此嗎。","origin":"paratranz","since":"raw-20261029","rules":"fb2b0969a45c0ef78713157c38556f810fa441a5"}
{"key":"RPGSystem/rpg-loc-dialogue-common-a1c10p2.json|/dataList/3/key","kr_sha":"89f79f99b8c400119d68e5ca09fc0af39adff8b08a0e12f659f0c6a6106d4d12","zh":"D91002_B","origin":"copy","since":"raw-20261029","rules":"fb2b0969a45c0ef78713157c38556f810fa441a5"}
{"key":"RPGSystem/rpg-loc-dialogue-common-a1c10p2.json|/dataList/3/texts/0/text","kr_sha":"d12759e7acfa9b31db85d4603f5484eca21e30ae6dce4fc7f9acdd03c1359228","zh":"一名孩子從星化作水並散落而下。","origin":"paratranz","since":"raw-20261029","rules":"fb2b0969a45c0ef78713157c38556f810fa441a5"}
{"key":"RPGSystem/rpg-loc-dialogue-common-a1c10p2.json|/dataList/3/texts/1/text","kr_sha":"5e0b46ecb6c82887861890a554d3846b981f813322e8f0cfd2646d4a8896835b","zh":"將心靈以物質形式呈現的水。Cogito。","origin":"paratranz","since":"raw-20261029","rules":"fb2b0969a45c0ef78713157c38556f810fa441a5"}
{"key":"RPGSystem/rpg-loc-dialogue-common-a1c10p2.json|/dataList/3/texts/2/text","kr_sha":"c184aee793b5083a8e1b6cd45ddc7b187a3dc2540a0b4734596866ce96dd3b22","zh":"透過使用Cogito的實驗得到了確信。","origin":"paratranz","since":"raw-20261029","rules":"fb2b0969a45c0ef78713157c38556f810fa441a5"}
{"key":"RPGSystem/rpg-loc-dialogue-common-a1c10p2.json|/dataList/3/texts/3/text","kr_sha":"9da3e13ce9e3ad08f8b6a48d25583efc30fbe53190694b80d89f0a179c230cba","zh":"樹木結了十顆果實。","origin":"paratranz","since":"raw-20261029","rules":"fb2b0969a45c0ef78713157c38556f810fa441a5"}
{"key":"RPGSystem/rpg-loc-dialogue-common-a1c10p2.json|/dataList/3/texts/4/text","kr_sha":"c49b04a8d22bc54bec15d65bc059bedde9a6c8fc174fa4f0c843915df097fdd8","zh":"樹木分為三個領域。","origin":"paratranz","since":"raw-20261029","rules":"fb2b0969a45c0ef78713157c38556f810fa441a5"}
{"key":"RPGSystem/rpg-loc-dialogue-common-a1c10p2.json|/dataList/3/texts/5/text","kr_sha":"f4f7818922fc2f697199f28f27e6ebf4536686f32d6eff813cd857a211ac4d79","zh":"沿著攀登樹木的順序具有其意義。","origin":"paratranz","since":"raw-20261029","rules":"fb2b0969a45c0ef78713157c38556f810fa441a5"}
{"key":"RPGSystem/rpg-loc-dialogue-common-a1c10p2.json|/dataList/4/key","kr_sha":"08326763d212359cda75bd6dc20a5f4f8b670380d7437f64a7a0c0571a7abfd0","zh":"D91003_B","origin":"copy","since":"raw-20261029","rules":"fb2b0969a45c0ef78713157c38556f810fa441a5"}
{"key":"RPGSystem/rpg-loc-dialogue-common-a1c10p2.json|/dataList/4/texts/0/text","kr_sha":"2c9aac3f2b150a3814cbad204db2f9cb852b58ad2b3814396687cfbd7393670d","zh":"即使心靈的模樣並非樹木。","origin":"paratranz","since":"raw-20261029","rules":"fb2b0969a45c0ef78713157c38556f810fa441a5"}
{"key":"RPGSystem/rpg-loc-dialogue-common-a1c10p2.json|/dataList/4/texts/1/text","kr_sha":"0aa3d3f16e45d31ae8988e3e41c54427de9e0366ca3e6a8b3529df0dbb3295d6","zh":"若能以樹木之形固定並解釋，那便是值得一試的方法。","origin":"paratranz","since":"raw-20261029","rules":"fb2b0969a45c0ef78713157c38556f810fa441a5"}
{"key":"RPGSystem/rpg-loc-dialogue-common-a1c10p2.json|/dataList/4/texts/2/text","kr_sha":"8cc63b9ff4c552deeeaa4db919ff4776d4bd06e2589be4ae578c055053f2472d","zh":"語言不也是如此嗎。","origin":"paratranz","since":"raw-20261029","rules":"fb2b0969a45c0ef78713157c38556f810fa441a5"}
{"key":"RPGSystem/rpg-loc-dialogue-common-a1c10p2.json|/dataList/4/texts/3/text","kr_sha":"086c9be73983f7884ee9dd7236295402517de27788443509d0fdeb80001c6878","zh":"將毫無意義的聲音以語言的形式禁錮並賦予意義而能■■交流。","origin":"paratranz","since":"raw-20261029","rules":"fb2b0969a45c0ef78713157c38556f810fa441a5"}
{"key":"RPGSystem/rpg-loc-dialogue-common-a1c10p2.json|/dataList/4/texts/4/text","kr_sha":"bc5d8840371a593999dc7c8e273aad2b3b7d23adb698077b44e8e55231106940","zh":"將這顆不可見且不安定的心靈定義為樹木。","origin":"paratranz","since":"raw-20261029","rules":"fb2b0969a45c0ef78713157c38556f810fa441a5"}
{"key":"RPGSystem/rpg-loc-dialogue-common-a1c10p2.json|/dataList/5/key","kr_sha":"d87b0da36af449b1944c2c497899a30054cb5ddff2ac7091144d3d038df2c1c2","zh":"D91004_B","origin":"copy","since":"raw-20261029","rules":"fb2b0969a45c0ef78713157c38556f810fa441a5"}
{"key":"RPGSystem/rpg-loc-dialogue-common-a1c10p2.json|/dataList/5/texts/0/text","kr_sha":"74f1cf8e6a9957bc3366d6437b6ff2bb1d1088289aac520342cee140cfda0869","zh":"Cogito會用相同性質吸引相同存在。以最不會引起抗拒的形式。","origin":"paratranz","since":"raw-20261029","rules":"fb2b0969a45c0ef78713157c38556f810fa441a5"}
{"key":"RPGSystem/rpg-loc-dialogue-common-a1c10p2.json|/dataList/5/texts/1/text","kr_sha":"12cbaf53743f7549f9c67aabc6c77eb720bf7526e8a6df4949bca6b9ffc469c3","zh":"但對我們而言需要的並非是拉上來，而是讓其綻放。","origin":"paratranz","since":"raw-20261029","rules":"fb2b0969a45c0ef78713157c38556f810fa441a5"}
{"key":"RPGSystem/rpg-loc-dialogue-common-a1c10p2.json|/dataList/5/texts/2/text","kr_sha":"e1c197a81e403e632865ce265804c2c25d8dfde665264c80dc36ab5bd958d1fd","zh":"水桶必須化為種子。必須成為破土而出的意志。","origin":"paratranz","since":"raw-20261029","rules":"fb2b0969a45c0ef78713157c38556f810fa441a5"}
{"key":"RPGSystem/rpg-loc-dialogue-common-a1c10p2.json|/dataList/5/texts/3/text","kr_sha":"4cf49fcb91883919891c26377c8271c0691205448e58f6d14977a3e16f435528","zh":"為此需要將人類物質性的身體，將那構造依銘刻於基因中的設計來建構。","origin":"paratranz","since":"raw-20261029","rules":"fb2b0969a45c0ef78713157c38556f810fa441a5"}
{"key":"RPGSystem/rpg-loc-dialogue-common-a1c10p2.json|/dataList/5/texts/4/text","kr_sha":"36448c8097f16af12bdbab161f5ad2492dcfcd03cff51b410bd44c70487fb446","zh":"必須將刻印著樹木圖像的設計深植於人們之中。","origin":"paratranz","since":"raw-20261029","rules":"fb2b0969a45c0ef78713157c38556f810fa441a5"}
{"key":"RPGSystem/rpg-loc-dialogue-common-a1c10p2.json|/dataList/5/texts/5/text","kr_sha":"6ba35ec60e8cd863189b4dd7eadfe34e62d67d4ef3d646da0b8d04617b8db878","zh":"……但該怎麼做呢？","origin":"paratranz","since":"raw-20261029","rules":"fb2b0969a45c0ef78713157c38556f810fa441a5"}
{"key":"RPGSystem/rpg-loc-dialogue-common-a1c10p2.json|/dataList/5/texts/6/text","kr_sha":"9fb6b7e8c4dad6a935840e0eb0c0e96e17a6101201e759ba20da9bafc4428302","zh":"或許Cogito的型態並非水，而是光才對。","origin":"paratranz","since":"raw-20261029","rules":"fb2b0969a45c0ef78713157c38556f810fa441a5"}
{"key":"RPGSystem/rpg-loc-dialogue-common-a1c10p2.json|/dataList/5/texts/7/text","kr_sha":"331043e8a5809bdaf5c982272fa68dd0ad176abf95f0c8a6c3ca1b05c2ac3ad5","zh":"注視某樣東西意味著光進入了我之中。","origin":"paratranz","since":"raw-20261029","rules":"fb2b0969a45c0ef78713157c38556f810fa441a5"}
{"key":"RPGSystem/rpg-loc-dialogue-common-a1c10p2.json|/dataList/5/texts/8/text","kr_sha":"258e60ed87668c821df5ed04c7c191c377cebeef8d0555a036e0a630903a5321","zh":"一旦注視便意味著它在無從抵抗的情況下深植其中。","origin":"paratranz","since":"raw-20261029","rules":"fb2b0969a45c0ef78713157c38556f810fa441a5"}
{"key":"RPGSystem/rpg-loc-dialogue-common-a1c10p2.json|/dataList/6/key","kr_sha":"91c8a122869bf1441d2e01343a82b1e0140d4d6d5d741d98c4525ad454347c44","zh":"D91005_B","origin":"copy","since":"raw-20261029","rules":"fb2b0969a45c0ef78713157c38556f810fa441a5"}
{"key":"RPGSystem/rpg-loc-dialogue-common-a1c10p2.json|/dataList/6/texts/0/text","kr_sha":"3ca30f3ae03c471ed7ca6e03855ff12fdeddebf20858cf642d229bfa2afa7f3b","zh":"如果你能轉世的話，你想成為什麼呢？","origin":"paratranz","since":"raw-20261029","rules":"fb2b0969a45c0ef78713157c38556f810fa441a5"}
{"key":"RPGSystem/rpg-loc-dialogue-common-a1c10p2.json|/dataList/6/texts/1/text","kr_sha":"c8ece1584fc34668013d936b019baa9afbcd1b04f3511cb161aa8f2718ccdcef","zh":"我還是……想成為一個擁有美妙嗓音的人。","origin":"paratranz","since":"raw-20261029","rules":"fb2b0969a45c0ef78713157c38556f810fa441a5"}
{"key":"RPGSystem/rpg-loc-dialogue-common-a1c10p2.json|/dataList/6/texts/2/text","kr_sha":"b13d318426d081461f0e1a84cdcbebbb3ed54123df675c408cfbdb5f8128e197","zh":"這樣每個人都能注意到我在說什麼了。","origin":"paratranz","since":"raw-20261029","rules":"fb2b0969a45c0ef78713157c38556f810fa441a5"}
{"key":"RPGSystem/rpg-loc-dialogue-common-a1c10p2.json|/dataList/6/texts/3/text","kr_sha":"e6a21d69978dd09e25f9214688977f72be8abfbbfbe767976ecb77ae660a5400","zh":"是因為人類源自於水，而身體裡流淌著水的關係嗎。","origin":"paratranz","since":"raw-20261029","rules":"fb2b0969a45c0ef78713157c38556f810fa441a5"}
{"key":"RPGSystem/rpg-loc-dialogue-common-a1c10p2.json|/dataList/6/texts/4/text","kr_sha":"dbdd3b2c1efcb190a566cc950d7d168e7bf6b55c15322a39ff10669fd0638acb","zh":"我所盼望的星星早已固定為水的形態了。","origin":"paratranz","since":"raw-20261029","rules":"fb2b0969a45c0ef78713157c38556f810fa441a5"}
{"key":"RPGSystem/rpg-loc-dialogue-common-a1c10p2.json|/dataList/6/texts/5/text","kr_sha":"f625d8eb488b44273e513811acc50de3fec59ff8d10c11ad4d541a73e42ba847","zh":"只要我思考，Cogito便會將我所渴望之物以物質形式呈現吧。","origin":"paratranz","since":"raw-20261029","rules":"fb2b0969a45c0ef78713157c38556f810fa441a5"}
{"key":"RPGSystem/rpg-loc-dialogue-common-a1c10p2.json|/dataList/6/texts/6/text","kr_sha":"097e4a3dbd6ea9ef93b09dc12c2932c7d64a2ef00f87060efb7691227c8f21db","zh":"只要我還活著，我所創造的Cogito會與星星相似的方式運作的話……","origin":"paratranz","since":"raw-20261029","rules":"fb2b0969a45c0ef78713157c38556f810fa441a5"}
{"key":"RPGSystem/rpg-loc-dialogue-common-a1c10p2.json|/dataList/6/texts/7/text","kr_sha":"f4fbfaad6961d737e1dc7501e68b427fd7e1448a4a372341618b91a1f8794473","zh":"那就還有辦法。治療所有人的辦法。","origin":"paratranz","since":"raw-20261029","rules":"fb2b0969a45c0ef78713157c38556f810fa441a5"}
{"key":"RPGSystem/rpg-loc-dialogue-common-a1c10p2.json|/dataList/6/texts/8/text","kr_sha":"a30fafd32e9f891cd84a7a31ee78f6ef99cb8a67fd68b5ec860d4b95c3a2b92c","zh":"這件事值得如此。所以你才連原因都沒有詢問過。","origin":"paratranz","since":"raw-20261029","rules":"fb2b0969a45c0ef78713157c38556f810fa441a5"}
{"key":"RPGSystem/rpg-loc-dialogue-common-a1c10p2.json|/dataList/6/texts/9/text","kr_sha":"0419aded0785ad077b5340f34144f302cff03d52251a9b8121738c56604e65c3","zh":"沒錯吧，Ayin……？","origin":"paratranz","since":"raw-20261029","rules":"fb2b0969a45c0ef78713157c38556f810fa441a5"}
{"key":"RPGSystem/rpg-loc-dialogue-common-a1c10p2.json|/dataList/6/texts/10/text","kr_sha":"9466d95f26c660b1568874e108605e5b41b4718d14197d99b9f40a6f17b906b1","zh":"那個唯一的方法。「光之種計畫草案」就放在這裡了。","origin":"paratranz","since":"raw-20261029","rules":"fb2b0969a45c0ef78713157c38556f810fa441a5"}
{"key":"RPGSystem/rpg-loc-dialogue-common-a1c10p2.json|/dataList/6/texts/11/text","kr_sha":"eb6ff82dd1ed28334ade57d7deaca8792762d362b6b44beb4086e114731bdc20","zh":"你一定可以撐過去的。","origin":"paratranz","since":"raw-20261029","rules":"fb2b0969a45c0ef78713157c38556f810fa441a5"}
{"key":"RPGSystem/rpg-loc-dialogue-common-a1c10p2.json|/dataList/6/texts/12/text","kr_sha":"f36b577d2dedb4a83680321cbb279dc230795d2551c34ee0bb460eef243d7f20","zh":"所以……拜託你了。","origin":"paratranz","since":"raw-20261029","rules":"fb2b0969a45c0ef78713157c38556f810fa441a5"}
{"key":"RPGSystem/rpg-loc-dialogue-common-a1c10p2.json|/dataList/6/texts/13/text","kr_sha":"ed75c7869d2a6bd8c212ba4510995f208fd7b3ee1d7bcf019946120896d69371","zh":"給親愛的後輩，Carmen。","origin":"paratranz","since":"raw-20261029","rules":"fb2b0969a45c0ef78713157c38556f810fa441a5"}
{"key":"RPGSystem/rpg-loc-dialogue-common-a1c10p2.json|/dataList/7/key","kr_sha":"402d3bcb5235d722ef54d476dc776cd3247511279055a5f736bea113b369567d","zh":"D91020_B","origin":"copy","since":"raw-20261029","rules":"fb2b0969a45c0ef78713157c38556f810fa441a5"}
{"key":"RPGSystem/rpg-loc-dialogue-common-a1c10p2.json|/dataList/7/texts/0/text","kr_sha":"5eec6271de73dc4fa506016bc75e93150ce3aadf554bfa10215222ca43e0d3c5","zh":"透過諮詢或對話無法治療靈魂。","origin":"paratranz","since":"raw-20261029","rules":"fb2b0969a45c0ef78713157c38556f810fa441a5"}
{"key":"RPGSystem/rpg-loc-dialogue-common-a1c10p2.json|/dataList/7/texts/1/text","kr_sha":"0499d3a3f911bac1175623e67eb6fa30b6df95a83010ea2724cda6e62d049152","zh":"在這圖像前心理諮詢不過是種原始且臨時的措施。","origin":"paratranz","since":"raw-20261029","rules":"fb2b0969a45c0ef78713157c38556f810fa441a5"}
{"key":"RPGSystem/rpg-loc-dialogue-common-a1c10p2.json|/dataList/7/texts/2/text","kr_sha":"b6785df2f283301623914bcff237e826333975c2bff17a07e8f70c6fc19f6f44","zh":"不過既然知道了人類心靈的模樣，現在不是就能診斷或治療嗎？","origin":"paratranz","since":"raw-20261029","rules":"fb2b0969a45c0ef78713157c38556f810fa441a5"}
{"key":"RPGSystem/rpg-loc-dialogue-common-a1c10p2.json|/dataList/7/texts/3/text","kr_sha":"6e228b3a51a73bf3e49ed2f62865e934bac7e5bf02a1282658f31bd8b52a66e1","zh":"這樣一來不光是我出生的N公司，就連這座都市強烈的苦痛都能受到治療。","origin":"paratranz","since":"raw-20261029","rules":"fb2b0969a45c0ef78713157c38556f810fa441a5"}
{"key":"RPGSystem/rpg-loc-dialogue-common-a1c10p2.json|/dataList/7/texts/4/text","kr_sha":"047e4ec0866201a91ae1688f5afbb114f2e2aa8259e063a0b43f06749856b656","zh":"治療在邁向死亡的旅程裡罹患無法認清自我之病的都市人們。","origin":"paratranz","since":"raw-20261029","rules":"fb2b0969a45c0ef78713157c38556f810fa441a5"}
{"key":"RPGSystem/rpg-loc-dialogue-common-a1c10p2.json|/dataList/8/key","kr_sha":"ecb2f03e1c0cc150caaed6963a6c912c8191a1f06396626ff1d5900ef0225e30","zh":"D91021_B","origin":"copy","since":"raw-20261029","rules":"fb2b0969a45c0ef78713157c38556f810fa441a5"}
{"key":"RPGSystem/rpg-loc-dialogue-common-a1c10p2.json|/dataList/8/texts/0/text","kr_sha":"4626580b89c39b1db00ee4c5f17a5f09c4776734124bb879c6b282b09b17bea0","zh":"這棵樹的形狀只是整理在各處發現的事物而成，並非是由我所規定的。","origin":"paratranz","since":"raw-20261029","rules":"fb2b0969a45c0ef78713157c38556f810fa441a5"}
{"key":"RPGSystem/rpg-loc-dialogue-common-a1c10p2.json|/dataList/8/texts/1/text","kr_sha":"423aa331c496f98841e04a23ecaff06756d7ed0b60bfa9e2d33dc12582cf154a","zh":"如同人類的身體存在著解剖圖般，這棵樹便是人類心靈的圖像。","origin":"paratranz","since":"raw-20261029","rules":"fb2b0969a45c0ef78713157c38556f810fa441a5"}
{"key":"RPGSystem/rpg-loc-dialogue-common-a1c10p2.json|/dataList/8/texts/2/text","kr_sha":"44ea9fcbda1146f2cde6b490051962851d544d4a363ac2dd215e3f0313d5ef33","zh":"要治療病人就需要理解其軀體。","origin":"paratranz","since":"raw-20261029","rules":"fb2b0969a45c0ef78713157c38556f810fa441a5"}
{"key":"RPGSystem/rpg-loc-dialogue-common-a1c10p2.json|/dataList/8/texts/3/text","kr_sha":"51960b958c1163881821102e9eae0382c61dab16e745031c736b207b8ee890a4","zh":"但至今都從未有人將靈魂或意識的構造視覺化，或將其系統化。","origin":"paratranz","since":"raw-20261029","rules":"fb2b0969a45c0ef78713157c38556f810fa441a5"}
{"key":"RPGSystem/rpg-loc-dialogue-common-a1c10p2.json|/dataList/9/key","kr_sha":"8cf9abf81c868d32d2a58a2aa623fe2c15380ee52e8f1438d4b57a8f4475596c","zh":"D91022_B","origin":"copy","since":"raw-20261029","rules":"fb2b0969a45c0ef78713157c38556f810fa441a5"}
{"key":"RPGSystem/rpg-loc-dialogue-common-a1c10p2.json|/dataList/9/texts/0/text","kr_sha":"76845b67d21f0c3be1d91c6f977717f0bbf3a5f604f5d638ff96d4b412a208fd","zh":"無論是任何形式，當事物作為物質存在便會定下其構造。","origin":"paratranz","since":"raw-20261029","rules":"fb2b0969a45c0ef78713157c38556f810fa441a5"}
{"key":"RPGSystem/rpg-loc-dialogue-common-a1c10p2.json|/dataList/9/texts/1/text","kr_sha":"b91112f3f9e73e3ddd104996a82ba12c4c3bf36a13821c56f29561cc3ae73e55","zh":"我將此認定為人類的命運。","origin":"paratranz","since":"raw-20261029","rules":"fb2b0969a45c0ef78713157c38556f810fa441a5"}
{"key":"RPGSystem/rpg-loc-dialogue-common-a1c10p2.json|/dataList/9/texts/2/text","kr_sha":"b351e15116f486e89053ddaeadcc155906ecdacbf67c1336354110988bed776d","zh":"這並非是承載著故事之類的命運。沒必要誇大其辭，這與基因相差無幾。","origin":"paratranz","since":"raw-20261029","rules":"fb2b0969a45c0ef78713157c38556f810fa441a5"}
{"key":"RPGSystem/rpg-loc-dialogue-common-a1c10p2.json|/dataList/9/texts/3/text","kr_sha":"443c3f01eb4cbe17150d57a81a097f918078d8d51f86b00264bca2ab7c54883f","zh":"正如離開水中的魚不能稱為魚，魚無論如何演化還是無法從水中逃離。","origin":"paratranz","since":"raw-20261029","rules":"fb2b0969a45c0ef78713157c38556f810fa441a5"}
