{"key":"RPGSystem/rpg-loc-dialogue-common-a1c10p2.json|/dataList/9/texts/5/text","kr_sha":"84772d860d53328313d222b48362cd1dac34a62a88ecf8432572fda8bc201cb8","zh":"而那東西碰巧形成了樹木的模樣。","origin":"paratranz","since":"raw-20261029","rules":"fb2b0969a45c0ef78713157c38556f810fa441a5"}
